Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Engineering ingenuity has driven us to the cutting edge of a new industrial age.\N工程智慧推动我们迈入新工业时代的前沿。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.17,0:00:11.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And AI infrastructure is accelerating the race with unprecedented speed.\N人工智能基础设施正以前所未有的速度加速这场竞赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:14.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pace isn't just increasing.\N进展速度不仅在加快。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:16.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's compounding.\N而且在持续叠加。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:18.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,The scale has changed.\N规模已经改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.47,0:00:27.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The complexity has multiplied and the innovation isn't slowing down.\N复杂性呈倍数增长，创新步伐并未放缓。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:32.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,To move at this speed, everything must be dialed.\N要达到如此速度，一切必须精准到位。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:36.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not only bigger systems, but smarter ones, modular by design.\N不仅是更大规模的系统，更是更智能的系统，从设计之初就具备模块化特性。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:47.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new approach to infrastructure, flexible where it matters, precise where it counts, built to scale from the start.\N一种全新的基础设施理念，关键处灵活，核心处精准，从一开始就具备可扩展性。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.24,0:00:49.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This isn't a collection of systems.\N这并非一系列独立系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a single machine.\N它是一台完整的机器。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:57.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,One continuous system moving at full throttle.\N一个持续运行、全速前进的统一系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this isn't just theory.\N这不仅仅是理论。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:06.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is deployed and proven with clear momentum and a first-to-market track record.\N它已经投入部署并得到验证，展现出明确的增长势头和率先入市的业绩记录。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Performance isn't added later.\N性能不是后期添加的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's engineered into every phase from the ground up.\N它从底层开始就融入了每一个阶段。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Super scale, micro focus.\N规模超大，专注入微。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.68,0:01:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every design optimized.\N每个设计都经过优化。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.32,0:01:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every component built for speed.\N每个组件都为速度而打造。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:30.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,When every layer is connected, when every system is dialed,\N当每一层都紧密连接，当每个系统都精准调校，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,when everything is built to accelerate as one, acceleration isn't a feature.\N当所有部分都协同加速时，加速就不再是功能。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:41.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the foundation.\N它是基石。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:44.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Supermicro, built to accelerate.\N美超微，专为加速而生。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:56.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, introducing Chairman, President, and CEO, Charles Liang.\N各位女士先生，隆重介绍董事长、总裁兼首席执行官梁见后。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:59.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:00.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.48,0:02:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome everyone to our innovate at a Computex.\N欢迎大家来到 Computex 上的 Supermicro Innovate 大会。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:14.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm very happy to see you all, especially here in Taipei, to our partners,\N我非常高兴见到大家，尤其是来到台北的各位合作伙伴，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:20.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,our customers, and all our press friends from over the world.\N各位客户，以及来自世界各地的媒体朋友们。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:24.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you all for joining us today.\N感谢大家今天参与。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:28.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The AI revolution has only just begun.\NAI 革命才刚刚开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:35.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyday we see many new AI applications and new adoptions\N每天我们都能看到大量新的 AI 应用和新采用场景，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:43.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,to improve almost every aspect of our work and our lives.\N正在改善我们工作和生活的方方面面。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:52.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our partners are coming to Supermicro and they all are asking us for help.\N我们的合作伙伴纷纷来到美超微，都向我们寻求帮助。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:03:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Help to develop system and solution that can accelerate their LLM,\N帮助他们开发能够加速其大语言模型的系统和解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,new cloud, enterprise AI, solving AI, or other AI applications.\N新云、企业AI、AI解决方案或其他AI应用。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,As AI revolution continues to grow everywhere, for every application, and looks never ending.\N随着AI革命持续在全球各地不断增长，应用于每个场景，且似乎永无止境。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm super excited to share our latest experience,\N我非常激动地与大家分享我们的最新体验，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,our new innovations, and our total solution with you.\N我们的新创新以及我们的完整解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:43.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Most importantly, I want to invite you to grow at our speed,\N最重要的是，我想邀请您以我们的速度成长，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:48.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,at our pace, or even much faster.\N以我们的节奏成长，甚至更快。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, in this incredible AI era, most of them are racing as fast as they can.\N你知道，在这个令人惊叹的AI时代，大多数都在以最快的速度竞速。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:04:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company, every country, every data center want to ride this AI wave.\N每家公司、每个国家、每个数据中心都想乘上这股AI浪潮。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, how can you best to do it?\N但你该如何最好地做到这一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just do it, but best to do it.\N不只是做到，而是以最佳方式做到。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:12.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Optimize the chance.\N优化机会。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:18.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,If your data center infrastructure, for example, is delayed for 1 month,\N比如说，如果你的数据中心基础设施延迟一个月，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:25.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,3 months, sometimes 6 months, you are losing massive opportunities.\N三个月，有时甚至六个月，你都在错失巨大的机会。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:28.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we all know that time is money.\N我们都知道，时间就是金钱。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in lots of case, time is a much more than money.\N在许多情况下，时间比金钱更重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:38.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,How faster can your technology investment be online?\N你的技术投资能多快上线？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:45.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Online start to make a money and start to generate profitability.\N上线后开始赚钱，并开始产生利润。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:48.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Think about that.\N请好好想想这一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:54.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even just a few months or a quarter delay, your business may get hurt.\N即使只是延迟几个月或一个季度，你的业务也可能受到损害。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:05:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just millions or even billion dollars of income loss, but the whole business opportunity may disappear.\N不仅仅是数百万甚至数十亿美元的收入损失，整个商业机会也可能消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:17.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Simply put, every single day your system and your data center sitting idle is a direct hurt to your bottom line.\N简而言之，你的系统和数据中心每天闲置，都会直接损害你的利润底线。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:25.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why we are focusing so much to help you, our key partner,\N这就是为什么我们如此专注于帮助你们，我们的关键合作伙伴，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:36.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to improve this one key metric, time to online, time to operation, time to make a money.\N改善这一关键指标：上线时间、运营时间、赚钱时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The good news is a Supermicro can help.\N好消息是，美超微可以帮上忙。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:41.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are here.\N我们在这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:45.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at the this equation behind me.\N看看我身后的这个方程。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:51.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Time to market new technology, new product turn to market.\N新技术、新产品从研发到上市的时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.18,0:05:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Plus time to deploy, not just send the product to your warehouse,\N加上部署时间，不只是把产品送到你的仓库，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:06:05.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,to your data center, but to deploy and make them plug and play online quickly.\N送到你的数据中心，而是要快速部署并实现即插即用的在线运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:07.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Time to online.\N上线时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:15.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once online, then you can start to generate the profitability.\N一旦上线，你就可以开始产生盈利。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:21.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can ship new generation AI platform to you earlier.\N我们可以更早地向你交付新一代AI平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:25.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Make your AI data center online faster.\N让你的AI数据中心更快上线。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,How about 3 months?\N三个月怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.68,0:06:30.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Faster sounds.\N更快听起来更好。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,How much impact?\N会产生多大影响？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:33.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,How about a year?\N一年怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:35.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or 6 months ahead?\N或者提前六个月呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:36.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you how.\N我来告诉你们怎么做。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can you work together to achieve that?\N你们如何协作来实现这一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:43.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,How about that?\N怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is only a small fraction of our famous building block solution.\N这只是我们著名积木式方案的一小部分。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:51.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you can see, uh especially old partner, right?\N如你所见，尤其是老合作伙伴，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:55.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, Supermicro might call it the most optimized system.\N你知道，美超微可能会称它为最优化的系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly optimized for your business.\N完全针对你的业务进行了优化。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:09.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because in most case, we are able to engineer new generation system quickly by leveraging some of our existing sub system.\N因为在大多数情况下，我们能够通过利用现有的一些子系统，快速设计出新一代系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:17.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like some other board we can share, some enclosure, power supply, and so much sub system.\N比如一些通用的主板、机箱、电源，以及大量可共享的子系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:24.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,The new system created by this building block don't just not just work fine.\N通过这种积木式方案创建的新系统，不仅运行良好。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.43,0:07:26.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fully optimized.\N完全经过优化。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:28.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Optimized for performance.\N针对性能进行优化。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Optimized for performance per dollars.\N针对每美元投入的性能进行优化。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,For energy efficient.\N为了能效更高。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And even for lower cost of you.\N甚至为了降低您的成本。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:39.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Optimization, right?\N优化，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:42.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Based on our building block solution.\N基于我们的积木式方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,This building block DNA is why we are always the first to market since 33 years ago.\N正是这种积木式架构的DNA，让我们自33年前以来始终率先上市。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even now, we always have a faster time to market advantage.\N即便现在，我们依然拥有更快的上市优势。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:08:01.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Optimize AI infrastructure quicker.\N更快速地优化AI基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:02.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the reality.\N这就是现实。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over a past couple of years, Supermicro has successfully deployed the world's absolute largest AI data center.\N在过去几年里，美超微已成功部署了全球规模最大的AI数据中心。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:23.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We deliver this massive cutting-edge data center on timing\N我们按时交付了这座规模庞大的前沿数据中心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,tighter timing line and achieve incredible tier one customer satisfaction.\N通过更精准的工期控制，实现了令人惊叹的一流客户满意度
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:41.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let me tell you, these customers are some of the most picky, most demanding technology operator in the whole world.\N让我告诉你们，这些客户是全球最挑剔、要求最严苛的技术运营商之一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:43.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,They demand perfection.\N他们追求完美
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:46.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,They demand extreme efficiency,\N他们追求极致的效率
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we deliver exactly what they need with close cooperation with our partner,\N我们通过与合作伙伴的紧密协作，精准交付了他们所需的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:58.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,vendor partner, and customer for sure.\N无论是供应商合作伙伴，还是客户，都确保了项目成功
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have built it our world's first gigawatt liquid-cooling DLC AI data center in less than 5 months 2 years ago.\N两年前，我们仅用不到5个月时间，建成了全球首个吉瓦级液冷DLC AI数据中心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:17.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And recently, we just indeed finished another gigawatt data center in about 3 months.\N最近，我们又仅用约3个月时间，完成了另一座吉瓦级数据中心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:22.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, faster and faster because we leverage our experience,\N所以越来越快，因为我们充分利用了自身经验
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:31.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,leverage our building block solution, leverage the our data center building block solution.\N充分利用我们的积木式解决方案，以及数据中心积木式解决方案
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:36.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, for many long-term partner here,\N好了，对于在场的许多长期合作伙伴来说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know that we have been one of our original server uh storage solution provider on the market since uh earlier 1990s.\N众所周知，我们自上世纪90年代初以来，就是市场上最早的服务器和存储解决方案提供商之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:51.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we don't chase the uh movement.\N因此，我们不会盲目追逐潮流。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:55.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We we have been uh doing this for over 33 years.\N我们已经持续从事这项工作超过33年。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:57.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Always time to market.\N始终以最快的速度推向市场。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:10:09.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we continue to have the broadest system level building block solution in the industry ready for you.\N如今，我们依然在行业内提供最全面的系统级积木式解决方案，随时待命。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:17.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we have our X14 H14 uh portfolio in volume deployment since many years ago.\N我们的X14和H14系列产品已多年实现批量部署。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:27.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now we have a X15 uh Intel CPU-based H15 uh AMD uh processor-based and uh\N现在我们推出了基于英特尔CPU的X15和基于AMD处理器的H15，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:33.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,N15 NVIDIA CPU-GPU-based solution and a new one\N以及基于英伟达CPU-GPU的N15解决方案和一款全新产品。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,A15 Arm-based uh system and rack solution.\N还有基于Arm架构的A15系统和机架解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, all those uh ready for OEM order today.\N所有这些产品今天即可接受OEM订单。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,We also have those brand new Arm AGI platform that I'm super excited about.\N我们还推出了全新的Arm AGI平台，我对此非常激动。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:11:02.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are incredible platform for large cloud uh enterprise age compute and especially for agentic AI.\N它们是大型云、企业级计算的卓越平台，尤其适用于代理式AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:08.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the highest uh core density, massive memory bandwidth,\N拥有最高的核心密度、巨大的内存带宽，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,and flexible configuration, we will be able to ship them very soon.\N以及灵活的配置，我们将能够很快完成发货。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:20.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Either system level, rack level, or cluster level.\N无论是系统级、机架级，还是集群级。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:29.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And look at right here on the stage, our massive uh accelerate GPU solution.\N请看舞台正前方，我们大规模的加速 GPU 解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:32.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,We We one of the largest the of\N我们是全球最大的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:43.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA Blackwell GB300, B300 HGX a solution provider.\N英伟达 Blackwell GB300、B300 HGX 解决方案提供商之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:52.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed in last 9 months last three quarter we ship more than 8,000 rack so far.\N事实上，在过去的九个月里，也就是最近三个季度，我们已发货超过 8,000 个机架。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:58.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we ship also very high volume B300 HGX.\N我们还发运了大量高密度的 B300 HGX。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.07,0:12:09.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because as you know we are building block solution leader we always ship product to customer earlier than others.\N因为众所周知，我们是积木式解决方案的领导者，总是比别人更早将产品交付客户。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:17.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we are getting ready for the upcoming Vera Rubin NVL\N我们正在为即将到来的 Vera Rubin NVL72 做准备，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:23.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,72 indeed we already ship some sample to a certain customer.\N事实上，我们已经向某客户交付了一些样品。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:26.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so far their experience was great.\N到目前为止，他们的体验非常出色。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:31.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we are preparing for high volume production for you to to order today.\N我们正在为高产量生产做准备，您今天就可以下单。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:36.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then Rubin HGX right.\N然后是 Rubin HGX，没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:43.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rubin HGX we support eight node 64 GPU\NRubin HGX 我们支持八节点 64 个 GPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:48.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,or nine node or can be with another different\N或九节点，也可以配置为其他不同形式。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:53.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,configuration kind of like this configuration uh we can\N就像这种配置，我们能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:13:04.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,support 64 128 or 144 R200 system to you.\N为您提供 64、128 或 144 个 R200 系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.79,0:13:07.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And sample is about now.\N样机现在就可以提供。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:11.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And production yes in next few months.\N生产版将在接下来的几个月内推出。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:18.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And also Vera CPU base right.\N还有 Vera CPU 基础架构，没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:20.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rubin base and Vera base right.\NRubin 基础架构和 Vera 基础架构，没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera base you know CPU NVIDIA CPU base.\NVera 基础架构，也就是英伟达的 CPU 平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.12,0:13:29.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again kind of lots of different congregation.\N再次说明，有多种不同的配置组合。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:34.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, already about simply now is is time to put it simple, right?\N嗯，现在简单点说，就是该简单的时候了，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, first to come, first to serve, right?\N嗯，先到先服务，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:42.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And for sure you are first priority because you are our close partner, right?\N而且你肯定是首要优先级，因为你是我们的紧密合作伙伴，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:50.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, all of those are optimized for large AI and HPC,\N嗯，所以这些针对大规模 AI 和 HPC 的模块化优化，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.98,0:13:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh, inferencing and agentic AI, right?\N推理、HPC 和代理式 AI，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:14:00.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, why is this module uh, all modularized design, right?\N嗯，为什么这个模块是完全模块化设计的，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, building block solution approach uh, so critical, so good for the market,\N嗯，积木式方案的方法非常关键，对市场非常有利，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, because uh, global IT uh, build out uh, changing very fast uh, as you know.\N嗯，因为全球 IT 建设正在飞速变化，这个你很清楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,A data center and enterprise now uh, moving from uh, single high performance workload to more complex uh,\N现在数据中心和企业正从单一高性能工作负载，转向更复杂的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI AI and HPC, uh, so many AI, uh, inferencing and uh, many kind of uh, AI applications.\NAI 和 HPC，各种 AI、推理以及多种类型的 AI 应用。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:39.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, if you try to optimize your server and data center from scratch,\N所以，如果你试图从零开始优化你的服务器和数据中心，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:45.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will run into a uh, massive of engineering bottleneck.\N你就会遇到巨大的工程瓶颈。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.56,0:14:48.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And those are uh, time to market delay.\N这些就是上市时间的延迟。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:55.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why based on modularized uh, building block solution, direct scale plug and play, that's the best way to go.\N正因为如此，基于模块化的积木式方案，实现直接扩展即插即用，这是最佳选择。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.83,0:15:00.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Supermicro, as you know, we are the expert uh, for those uh,\N众所周知，美超微正是这一领域的专家，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh, approach for 20 years, more than 20 years, right?\N这种方法我们已经深耕了二十年，甚至超过二十年，没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh, and more importantly, I mean uh, uh, how quickly can you deploy them um, other than make a product available, right?\N所以，更重要的是，除了让产品可得之外，你能多快完成部署？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And how can we uh, have a high volume deploy for you?\N我们如何为你实现大规模的快速部署？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:24.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.87,0:15:28.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this putting us to a time to deploy, right?\N这正是我们关注部署时间的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:35.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the old day, deploy uh data center mean uh receive thousand of box.\N以前部署数据中心意味着要接收成千上万的机箱。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.15,0:15:38.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you unbox them and integrate to a rack.\N然后你需要拆箱，把它们集成到机架中。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:43.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then uh testing everything uh in data center.\N接着在数据中心里对所有设备进行测试。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.18,0:15:44.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,And cabling.\N还有布线。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:47.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then uh kind of uh take a lot of time.\N然后，呃，大概需要花很多时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.96,0:15:49.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trial and error, right?\N试错，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, now instead, we ship you in a kind of computer rack.\N所以现在，我们给你寄去一个类似计算机机架的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:57.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything is pretty test.\N所有东西都经过充分测试。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:58.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pretty validated.\N经过充分验证。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.69,0:16:02.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, when we ship to your data center, it's ready to run.\N所以当我们把产品送到你的数据中心时，它可以直接运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:05.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,A true plug and play.\N真正的即插即用。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have some customer say, "Hey, they buy uh from others.\N有些客户说：“嘿，他们从别人那里买来的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,They plug and cannot play."\N插上却无法运行。”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:16.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,They plug and have to fix.\N插上后还得修复。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:17.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And another fix.\N然后又得修一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.42,0:16:18.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And finally play.\N最后才终于能用。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, take too long.\N所以，时间太长了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:20.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh we have been working together for many years, you know.\N我们已经合作很多年了，你知道的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:27.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our plug and play uh is pretty much true plug and play.\N我们的即插即用方案基本上就是真正的即插即用。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.85,0:16:31.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,With everything uh pretty designed, pretty optimized, pretty validated.\N所有东西都经过精心设计、充分优化并验证过。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, when we ship to you, it's a fully uh ready for a plug and play.\N所以，我们交付给你时，它已经完全准备好即插即用。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:48.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we save a lot of labor intensive uh uh job for you and uh uh minimize the overall uh risk.\N这样我们为你节省了大量繁重的人工工作，同时最大限度降低整体风险。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:49.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,We ship everything uh to you uh with uh all pretty validated.\N我们把所有东西都交付给你，全部都已经过验证。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:17:05.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's why when it's still together, it's just ready to work.\N所以，当它们在一起时，就能直接投入使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:07.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, that's PDD, right?\N所以，这就是 PDD，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:12.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh also, because uh uh the demand is getting bigger, right?\N另外，因为需求越来越大，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.48,0:17:23.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, as you may know, uh 2 years ago, our revenue was just uh 20 uh 15 billion, and then 22 billion, and then this year can be 40 billion.\N你们可能知道，两年前我们的营收只有大约150亿，然后是220亿，今年可能达到400亿。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.53,0:17:27.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next year can be much, much more than 40 billion, right?\N明年可能远超400亿，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, indeed we have been expanding our uh manufacture capacity uh very fast.\N所以，我们确实在非常快速地扩大制造产能。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.73,0:17:43.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um For example, in USA, uh we just added eight building in last third quarter.\N比如说在美国，我们仅在上个季度就新增了八栋建筑。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we added uh 1.4 million square feet all in San Jose.\N我们在圣何塞新增了140万平方英尺的面积。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:54.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh because no enough time to extend to to other state yet, right?\N因为还没有足够时间扩展到其他州，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:18:01.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we are uh extended very fast in Silicon Valley, and now have a much higher uh capacity for you.\N所以我们在硅谷的扩展非常迅速，现在产能大幅提升，能更好地满足你们的需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:04.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's Taipei in uh Taiwan,\N还有台湾的台北，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.94,0:18:13.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,we also added two more building uh to uh uh exactly uh enlarge our capacity so\N我们也新增了两栋建筑，以进一步扩大产能，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:21.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,that we can huge volume production with best quality and ship it to you with rack scale,\N从而实现大规模、高质量的生产，并以机架级规模交付给你们，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.39,0:18:26.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,rack scale plug and play, and ready to run.\N机架级即插即用，开箱即用。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.84,0:18:37.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh even uh 3 years ago, uh our capacity only about two to three million square feet,\N所以，即使在三年前，我们的产能也只有大约两到三百万平方英尺。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:41.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,but today global, we have a six million square feet.\N但如今，我们的全球产能已达六百万平方英尺。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh our capacity is uh fully ready for your big demand, big demand.\N所以，我们的产能完全准备好应对您的大规模需求，大规模需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.48,0:18:59.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,We help you by a consolidated compute, storage, networking, power, and cooling into complete pretest again plug and play, right?\N我们通过整合计算、存储、网络、电力和冷却，为您提供完整的预测试、即插即用方案，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:04.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,For uh uh rack-scale L11, L12 solution.\N针对机架级 L11、L12 解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.25,0:19:08.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,When it is low of our shipping bay,\N当它从我们的出货码头运出时，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:16.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh it's ready to go straight to your data center floor and ready for plug and play.\N可直接运送到您的数据中心机房，即刻准备就绪，即插即用。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:21.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at this beautiful integrated rack sitting here.\N看看这个精美的集成机架，就摆在这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:22.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:27.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guess this is a Vera Rubin NVL72.\N我猜这是一台 Vera Rubin NVL72。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:28.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:40.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a Vera Rubin NVL72 with a fully optimized battery uh power shelf.\N这是一台配备完全优化电池电源托架的 Vera Rubin NVL72。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.79,0:19:47.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,And some customer if you want a BPU battery backup system, we have that for you.\N如果您需要 BPU 电池备份系统，我们也能为您提供。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.64,0:19:54.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, everything kind of pre-validated and fully optimized for you.\N再次强调，所有内容都已预先验证并完全为您优化。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.03,0:19:58.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And even this rack, you can see this rack is so strong.\N就连这个机架，你也能看出它有多么坚固。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.84,0:20:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guess this rack can carry a 5,000 lb of equipment.\N我猜这个机架能承载5000磅的设备。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:10.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason why we design our own rack is to optimize everything.\N我们设计自有机架的原因，是为了实现全方位优化。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.30,0:20:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Make sure mechanical is fine-tuned and is easy for your installation, easy for your maintenance.\N确保机械结构经过精细调校，便于您的安装和维护。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:25.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And also rack is strong enough even for large earthquake.\N同时，机架坚固到足以应对大型地震。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:36.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The system makes sure stability running your data center without interrupt.\N该系统确保数据中心稳定运行，不会中断。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:43.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, so no downtime mean a chance to win to make a more money.\N因此，零停机意味着更多盈利机会，能赚取更多收入。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:47.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, look at the how we handle power.\N现在，来看看我们如何处理供电。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:48.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:53.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, we design our own power shelf including a BPU.\N再次强调，我们自行设计了电源机架，包含一个BPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.84,0:21:04.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And kind of we provide a uh complete solution right including a water tower dry tower.\N我们提供了一整套解决方案，包括水塔和干式冷却塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.59,0:21:05.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:10.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,For some city, the water is not just sufficient.\N对某些城市来说，水资源并不仅够用。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:14.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,People the city may want you to save power and you may like to save power.\N城市可能希望你节约用电，你也愿意节约用电。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:26.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you can go for dry tower, water tower, kind of a all our CDU.\N所以你可以选择干冷塔、水冷塔，类似我们所有的CDU。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:35.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liquid to air, air to air when when your data center is traditional air-cooled data center,\N液冷转风冷、风冷转风冷，当你数据中心是传统的风冷数据中心时，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.36,0:21:41.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you want to run a DLC liquid cooling rack, right?\N但你想运行一个直接液冷（DLC）机架，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:48.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just have a air to air,\N你只需一个风冷转风冷，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:53.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,liquid to air cycle, 250 kW, 500 kW,\N液冷转风冷循环，250千瓦、500千瓦，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.80,0:22:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then you can run your DLC rack in traditional data center right away without spending a lot\N然后你就可以立即在传统数据中心运行你的DLC机架，而无需花费大量时间
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.12,0:22:11.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,months of time to convert your data center to install a DLC equipment and to spend the money,\N用数月时间将数据中心改造为安装DLC设备并投入资金，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.40,0:22:20.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Especially for enterprise uh kind of application,\N尤其是针对企业类应用，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.67,0:22:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI or kind of small size serving AI,\NAI，或者小规模的 AI 推理场景，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.64,0:22:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,this air to air ready to go, ready to install will be a big help.\N这种风冷转风冷的方案即装即用，安装方便，将大有帮助。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.72,0:22:35.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's talk about cooling.\N那么，我们来谈谈冷却系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:45.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, we provide a all different kind of CDU, kind of uh indoor CDU with different size,\N再次强调，我们提供各种类型的 CDU，包括不同尺寸的室内 CDU，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:54.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,1 MW, 3 MW, or 5 MW, or kind of like uh in rack CDU.\N1 兆瓦、3 兆瓦或 5 兆瓦，或者机架内 CDU。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.19,0:23:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed, Supermicro is one of the first company design and manufacture indoor CDU, right?\N事实上，美超微是最早设计和制造室内 CDU 的公司之一，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.13,0:23:03.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indoor CDU.\N室内 CDU。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.23,0:23:11.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of 125 kW, 250 kW or even a little bit larger size is coming.\N以及 125 千瓦、250 千瓦，甚至更大一些的型号也即将推出。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.88,0:23:17.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, either in rack or in-row CDU kind of chill door.\N无论是机架内 CDU、列间 CDU，还是冷却门。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:20.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Supermicro have a all different kind of chill door.\N美超微提供各种类型的冷却门。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:23.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, all our chill door are pre-designed pre-validated.\N再次强调，我们所有的冷却门都是预先设计并经过验证的。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.04,0:23:34.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, when we ship it like that to you, ship the chill door to you, ship the CDU to you, everything already well test well validated.\N因此，当我们把它们发给你时，发冷却门、发 CDU，所有部件都已充分测试并验证无误。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.77,0:23:35.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even the tower.\N就连塔楼也一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.88,0:23:41.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,When when we ship everything to your data center, it's kind of ready to plug and play.\N当我们把所有设备运送到您的数据中心时，基本上可以做到即插即用。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.01,0:23:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,\N所以，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.35,0:23:54.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can uh make it your cluster go for online right away.\N您可以让集群立即上线运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.08,0:24:05.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,To give our customer total peace of mind, we also develop a revolutionary uh a breakthrough in cooling chemistry.\N为了给客户带来完全的安心，我们还开发了一项冷却化学领域的革命性突破。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.36,0:24:06.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh our new coolant,\N我们的新冷却液，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.65,0:24:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have a some new coolant formula that feature up to 1,000 time higher electrical impedance than standard coolant.\N采用了一种新型冷却液配方，其电气阻抗比标准冷却液高出多达1000倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.60,0:24:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,For example here.\N比如说这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.12,0:24:25.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why the 1,000 time higher impedance can be a matter can be a great help?\N为什么1000倍的高阻抗会如此重要，能带来巨大帮助？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.04,0:24:32.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean uh first and foremost, in case you are wondering,\N嗯，首先，如果您好奇的话，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.52,0:24:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,our DLC system doesn't really leak — in fact, it never leaks.\N我们的直接液冷系统实际上不会泄漏——事实上，它从不泄漏。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.40,0:24:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in case there are small leak, when you have a high impedance electrical impedance CDU, the system keep running.\N但即便有微小泄漏，当您使用高电阻抗的 CDU 时，系统仍能持续运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.36,0:24:50.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not like a regular coolant.\N不像普通的冷却液。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.27,0:24:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your regular coolant, unfortunately, you have leakage, your system will be shut down.\N普通的冷却液，不幸的是，会有泄漏，系统就会停机。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.36,0:24:57.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you have to what?\N你得怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.08,0:24:58.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh send it R&D.\N嗯，送去研发部门。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.90,0:25:04.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,With our unique high-impedance CDU.\N通过我们独特的高阻抗 CDU。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.69,0:25:06.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your system keep it running.\N系统可以持续运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.88,0:25:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And for maintenance, you just shut down your system.\N至于维护，你只需关闭系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.52,0:25:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just replace the coolant and then your system can continue to run.\N只需更换冷却液，系统就能继续运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.92,0:25:29.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,And for some data center, you people really want to uh very safe uh concern for your staff.\N对某些数据中心来说，你们确实非常关心员工的安全。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.94,0:25:35.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is high impedance coolant also what?\N这种高阻抗冷却液还能防止什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.86,0:25:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Also prevent any uh shock and then short circuit.\N还能防止触电和短路。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.88,0:25:40.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, anyway,\N所以，不管怎样，
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.99,0:25:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean the uh uh customize cooling that can help you to build a really reliable unique data center or uh cluster.\N我的意思是，定制化冷却方案可以帮助你打造一个真正可靠且独特的数据中心或集群。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.24,0:25:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, time to online.\N好了，进入上线阶段。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.36,0:25:54.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.04,0:26:05.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh When the physical rack are sitting on your data center floor, you reach the next critical phase, time to online.\N当物理机架放置在你的数据中心地板上时，你就进入了下一个关键阶段——上线时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.15,0:26:07.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can you have a quicker time to online?\N你如何实现更快的上线时间？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.80,0:26:13.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh loading many rack onto a data center floor, they don't make you you uh money.\N把大量机架搬进数据中心后，它们并不会立刻为你带来收益。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.80,0:26:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.38,0:26:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have to uh make sure it's ready uh for operation.\N你必须确保它们已准备就绪，可以投入运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.24,0:26:21.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must push it to production.\N你必须将其推入生产环境。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.36,0:26:25.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to configure and run the network.\N你需要配置并运行网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.92,0:26:36.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,For the BIOS and operating system, install and validate the management software, test the thermal, and get uh the workload running.\N安装并验证BIOS和操作系统，安装并验证管理软件，测试散热性能，并让工作负载正常运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.21,0:26:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Supermicro provides you all of that support.\N而美超微为你提供了所有这些支持。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.08,0:26:43.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of those software.\N所有这些软件。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.28,0:26:44.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Recently,\N最近，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.10,0:26:48.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,we also introduced our 1.2 terabit uh CPO\N我们还推出了1.2太比特的CPO
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.20,0:26:56.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,optical switch uh engineered specifically to remove communication bottleneck\N光学交换机，专为消除大规模计算机集群中的通信瓶颈而设计，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.14,0:27:02.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,in massive scale uh computer cluster while delivering\N同时实现
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.01,0:27:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,ultra-low power, noise and latency and unmatched power density.\N超低功耗、低噪声和低延迟，以及无与伦比的高功率密度。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.24,0:27:22.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, to support our thermal uh realities of next generation days AI workload,\N此外，为了满足下一代 AI 工作负载的散热需求，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.48,0:27:28.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are delivering a full liquid cool energy and 1.\N我们正在交付一套完整的液冷能源和1。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.58,0:27:31.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,6 terabit switch platform.\N6太比特交换机平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.76,0:27:40.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,All about uh almost ready for sampling and we can start our production by end of this year.\N几乎已准备就绪，可于今年底开始量产。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.64,0:27:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And to eliminate a traditional third-party uh integration delay,\N为消除传统第三方集成带来的延迟，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.04,0:27:56.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,we pair our hardware with our own enhanced industry uh standard Sonic networking\N我们将硬件与自研的增强型行业标准 SONiC 网络相结合
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.16,0:28:06.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,operating system supporting both the community contribution and our fully supported enterprise version.\N支持社区贡献以及我们完全支持的企业版操作系统的软件。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.18,0:28:16.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, after your choice on top of all the networking layer, we provide an intelligent software stack.\N因此，在您选择所有网络层之后，我们将提供一个智能软件栈。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.52,0:28:27.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our supercluster software suite that including our supercloud composer, uh supercloud director, supercloud automation center,\N我们的超集群软件套件，包括我们的超云编排器、超云管理器、超云自动化中心，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.90,0:28:37.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh supercloud developer console and other software that give you uh unified uh single pane\N超云开发者控制台以及其他软件，为您提供统一的单一管理界面，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.28,0:28:46.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,a management uh platform across your data center uh capable of tracking real time uh telemetry,\N跨数据中心的管理平台，能够实时追踪遥测数据，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.88,0:28:48.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh power usage,\N功耗使用情况，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.58,0:28:59.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh and uh advanced leak detection across tens of thousands of system or right simultaneously.\N以及在数以万计的系统上同时进行高级泄漏检测。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.88,0:29:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This software unified our traditional system management to data center infrastructure management to solve a complex power,\N该软件将传统的系统管理统一为数据中心基础设施管理，以解决复杂的电力、
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.84,0:29:13.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,cooling, scaling, and other challenge.\N冷却、扩展及其他挑战。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.40,0:29:22.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our DCBBS software put critical one-stop solution to help\N我们的 DCBBS 软件提供关键的一站式解决方案，帮助您
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.30,0:29:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,you build your data center with faster time to online.\N更快地完成数据中心建设，缩短上线时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.60,0:29:30.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, time to make a money.\N再次强调，缩短赚钱的时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.72,0:29:35.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Optimize quality and performance at the most efficient cost.\N以最经济的成本优化质量和性能。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.56,0:29:41.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just quick, better quality, but again, we provide the what?\N不仅快速，质量更好，但再次强调，我们提供的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.12,0:29:47.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The most cost-efficient solution for our partner.\N为合作伙伴提供的最具成本效益的解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.24,0:29:54.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,We know hardware delivery and software support are not enough for lots\N我们知道，对于许多数据中心客户而言，仅提供硬件交付和软件支持是不够的。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.29,0:30:02.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,of data center customer who want to achieve the fastest time to operation.\N他们希望实现最快的操作上线时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.60,0:30:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,What what else?\N还有什么别的？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.48,0:30:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,To guarantee immediate revenue for your business, we don't just ship product.\N为了确保您的业务能够立即产生收入，我们不只是发货产品。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.52,0:30:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will help you on the path to activation\N我们将帮助您完成激活之路。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.05,0:30:24.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,with our expanded global onsite service and life cycle support.\N通过我们扩展的全球现场服务和全生命周期支持。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.92,0:30:28.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,All you need to have is what?\N你们需要具备什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.95,0:30:36.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,A good plan with great passion for your business, and of course, money, right?\N一份好的计划，对业务的极大热情，当然，还有钱，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.28,0:30:41.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we will do the rest of it for you.\N剩下的事情，我们将替您完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.72,0:30:47.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, it's kind of one-stop shop, one contact window,\N所以，这有点像一站式服务，一个对接窗口。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.72,0:30:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then your data center, your cloud, AI cloud ready to run.\N然后你的数据中心、你的云，就已准备就绪，可运行 AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.80,0:30:55.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,\N所以，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.23,0:31:01.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Supermicro service and implementation team are on site the\N美超微的服务与实施团队已抵达现场
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.95,0:31:08.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,moment when your rack arrive to handle complex physical hookup,\N你的机架抵达时，需要处理复杂的物理连接。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.12,0:31:17.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,secondary uh loop, and precision DLC plumbing connection.\N二级回路，以及精密的直接液冷管路连接。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.56,0:31:26.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,The team will also build a automatic a real-time validation protocol to execute the thermal, networking,\N团队还将建立一个自动化的实时验证协议，以执行热管理与网络连接测试。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.31,0:31:36.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and compute stress testing uh directly on the data center floor, uh eliminating any uh guesswork.\N并在数据中心机房内直接进行计算压力测试，彻底消除任何猜测。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.64,0:31:39.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And most importantly,\N最重要的是，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.60,0:31:51.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are vastly expanding our post-sales effort to ensure continuous uninterrupted uptime.\N我们正在大幅扩展售后支持，以确保系统持续稳定运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.60,0:32:02.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,We know that in the AI era, even a moment of downtime costs a lot of money, maybe million, maybe even billion dollars.\N在AI时代，哪怕是一瞬间的停机，也可能造成巨额损失，可能是数百万，甚至数十亿美元。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.24,0:32:13.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, to guarantee total peace of mind for your operation, uh in addition to having on-site technical service expert,\N因此，为了确保您运营的完全安心，除了配备现场技术专家服务外，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.56,0:32:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have established local depot uh to provide all the components,\N我们已建立本地备件库，以提供所有所需组件，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.16,0:32:26.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,the spare components that you need.\N以及您所需的备用组件。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.96,0:32:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this mean uh you can deliver critical uh we can deliver critical uh replacement parts exactly when you need them.\N因此，这意味着我们可以在您需要时，及时交付关键的替换部件。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.96,0:32:49.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our comprehensive life cycle um support ensure your IT team can 100% focus on your core strengths,\N我们全面的全生命周期支持，确保您的IT团队能100%专注于核心优势，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.60,0:32:53.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,knowing Supermicro have your back.\N知道美超微始终在您背后支持。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.96,0:33:01.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, DCBBS is how we help you.\N所以，DCBBS就是我们帮助您的方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.24,0:33:07.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,That way we help you uh achieve the best uh time to operation.\N这样我们就能帮助您实现最佳的上线时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.36,0:33:09.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, equal to time to make a money.\N再次强调，这等同于实现盈利的时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.28,0:33:11.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our DCBBS does not stop here.\N我们的DCBBS服务并不仅止于此。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.71,0:33:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Supermicro have a few other feature we will open to you when it's ready.\N美超微还有一些其他功能，待准备就绪后将向您开放。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.84,0:33:25.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, we talked about lots of couple lots of ground here.\N好的，我们刚才谈到了很多内容，覆盖了广泛的话题。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.46,0:33:31.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we all know that the agentic AI uh opportunity uh huge today.\N我们都知道，代理式AI的机会如今非常巨大。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.68,0:33:39.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today's special guest we all have us win more of those.\N今天我们的特别嘉宾，我们大家都希望他能再赢下更多。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.32,0:33:46.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before I invite him on stage, uh let me first introduce our CRO.\N在邀请他上台之前，让我先介绍一下我们的首席营收官。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.76,0:33:54.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Matt, are you here?\N马特，你在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.40,0:33:56.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,\N那么，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.96,0:34:06.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Matt will um uh moderating our next segment uh with uh senior VP from um Right.\N马特将与来自右方的高级副总裁共同主持接下来的环节。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.80,0:34:07.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.28,0:34:08.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mohamed, Mr. Mohamed.\N穆罕默德，穆罕默德先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.96,0:34:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.\N对。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.00,0:34:10.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.\N是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.04,0:34:11.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Charles.\N谢谢，查尔斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.03,0:34:20.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,As we look at the future of this computing infrastructure, the software layer and the hardware layer must connect even deeper.\N当我们展望计算基础设施的未来时，软件层与硬件层必须连接得更加紧密。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.36,0:34:22.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI workloads are changing.\NAI 工作负载正在发生变化。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.60,0:34:28.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are moving rapidly from pure training clusters to massive scale inference.\N我们正迅速从纯训练集群转向大规模推理。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.56,0:34:36.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Software AI and complex parallel agentic workflows To make these workflows truly efficient,\N软件 AI 与复杂的并行代理式工作流，要让这些工作流真正高效，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.44,0:34:41.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have to optimize our architectures all the way down to the silicon level.\N我们必须将架构优化贯穿到底层硅片级别。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.32,0:34:45.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Supermicro is deeply committed to the silicon-to-system synergy,\N美超微对硅片到系统之间的协同效应有着深刻承诺，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.89,0:34:54.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we work closely with the world's leading chip architects to enable maximum density and green computing efficiency.\N我们与全球领先的芯片架构师紧密合作，以实现最大密度和绿色计算效率。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.44,0:35:03.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,To talk about this next wave of silicon optimization, I'm incredibly honored and happy to welcome to a true industry visionary to the stage.\N接下来讨论下一代硅片优化，我深感荣幸且高兴地欢迎一位真正的行业先知登台。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.64,0:35:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please give a warm Supermicro welcome to the executive vice president of cloud AI at Arm Holdings,\N请大家以热烈的掌声欢迎 Arm 集团云 AI 执行副总裁，
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.76,0:35:19.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,my good friend Mohamed Awad.\N我的好朋友穆罕默德·阿瓦德。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.08,0:35:20.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Matt.\N谢谢，马特。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.08,0:35:21.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.08,0:35:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Great seeing you, Charles.\N很高兴见到你，梁见后。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.16,0:35:23.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.68,0:35:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, Charles, before we let you go, we have one question for you.\N所以，查尔斯，在我们让你离开之前，我们有一个问题想问你。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.12,0:35:28.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's your question?\N你的问题是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.84,0:35:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Supermicro is known for speed to market and deployment velocity.\N美超微以快速上市和快速部署著称。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.44,0:35:39.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is deployment speed becoming such a competitive advantage in AI infrastructure for Supermicro?\N为什么部署速度正成为美超微在AI基础设施领域的一项如此重要的竞争优势？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.68,0:35:40.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.00,0:35:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh infrastructure for agentic AI is all about time to first the token, right?\N代理式AI的基础设施，关键在于首词元时间，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.48,0:35:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's why uh we work with Arm uh to develop our building block solution for system level, for rack level, for data center level.\N正因为如此，我们与Arm合作，开发了面向系统级、机架级和数据中心级的积木式方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.56,0:36:03.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, with our building block solution, we see your technology, your CPU, your system architecture,\N通过我们的积木式方案，我们可以快速了解你的技术、你的CPU和你的系统架构，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.35,0:36:11.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,we can quickly bring your solution, bring your CPU power to the market as soon as customer need.\N一旦客户有需求，就能迅速将你的解决方案和CPU性能推向市场。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.24,0:36:11.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.\N完全正确。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.96,0:36:19.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh um the quicker our infrastructure get ready online, the quicker our customer can make money.\N我们的基础设施越快上线，客户就能越快赚钱。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.20,0:36:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, that's why I'm very happy to work with you.\N所以，我很高兴能与你们合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.76,0:36:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.\N当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.37,0:36:22.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.92,0:36:23.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.48,0:36:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.52,0:36:26.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Charles.\N谢谢，梁见后。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.48,0:36:26.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.96,0:36:27.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.44,0:36:37.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, Mohamed, I guess first question up, how is a gen AI changing the way our customers think about infrastructure compared to the last wave of gen AI?\N那么，穆罕默德，我想第一个问题，与上一轮生成式 AI 相比，\N生成式 AI 正如何改变客户对基础设施的思考方式？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.56,0:36:38.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I it's really wild.\N是的，这真的很惊人。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.93,0:36:46.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean the the the industry has kind of gone through this massive transformation over the last uh few years as as most of you know.\N众所周知，过去几年里，整个行业经历了一场巨大的转型。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.80,0:36:51.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um you know, gen AI was all about users interacting with machines.\N生成式 AI 最初关注的是用户与机器的交互。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.88,0:36:57.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, a user is set up to a prompt, puts a request in, a bunch of tokens are generated,\N也就是说，用户输入一个提示，发出请求，系统生成一系列词元，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.08,0:37:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,a CPU is there to kind of manage the the GPU or the accelerator, provide that response back to the user.\NCPU 的作用是管理 GPU 或加速器，并将响应返回给用户。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.76,0:37:08.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and that was great, and we saw a boom in in sort of accelerators on the back of it.\N嗯，那很棒，我们看到在那之后加速器迎来了爆发式增长。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.54,0:37:16.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,What we're seeing now with agentic is is it's kind of all shifting on its head where it's no longer about the user being the bottleneck.\N如今在代理式 AI 的推动下，情况发生了根本性转变，用户不再成为瓶颈。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.78,0:37:22.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's about, you know, CPUs responding directly.\N现在是 CPU 直接做出响应。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.07,0:37:31.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, agents now taking over and actually responding to that those tokens that are being generated by the accelerator,\N因此，智能体开始接管，并直接响应加速器生成的词元。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.27,0:37:35.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then maybe uh putting a bunch more requests into the accelerator.\N然后可能再向加速器提交大量新的请求。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.66,0:37:46.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this kind of fluid flow of accelerators and and CPUs constantly communicating with each other, and then CPUs going off and generating more agents.\N这种加速器与 CPU 之间持续不断通信的流动模式，使得 CPU 能够独立生成更多智能体。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.27,0:37:50.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you have agents generating agents, orchestrating additional agents.\N于是，智能体生成智能体，协调更多智能体的运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.92,0:37:55.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here's the thing about the agents, unlike humans, they never sleep.\N而智能体的特点是，与人类不同，它们从不休息。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.92,0:37:57.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, there is no bottleneck anymore.\N因此，瓶颈已经不存在了。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.28,0:38:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,There you have to respond at this kind of constant rate, and that's what's driving this massive influx and demand for more and more CPUs.\N你必须以这种持续不断的速率进行响应，这正是推动对更多 CPU 需求激增的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.12,0:38:12.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, on that topic, I mean, as you mentioned, orchestration is getting a heavier load, becoming more important.\N所以说到这一点，正如你提到的，编排正承受着越来越大的负载，变得愈发重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.44,0:38:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, some people are saying the CPU is becoming relevant again.\N有些人说，CPU 正在重新变得重要起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.96,0:38:19.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, I I think it was always relevant, so I don't know.\N嗯，我认为它一直都很重要，所以我不太明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.18,0:38:21.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a CPU guy, I think it was always relevant.\N作为一位 CPU 专家，我认为它始终都很重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.40,0:38:21.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N对。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.63,0:38:25.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no, I mean, I think I think what you're seeing is it's not like we we ever stopped using CPUs.\N对，我的意思是，你看到的其实是，我们从未停止使用 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.99,0:38:32.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,They were always there managing the accelerators, managing the infrastructure, managing the storage, managing the networking.\N它们始终在管理加速器、管理基础设施、管理存储、管理网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.60,0:38:41.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, what you're seeing now is that as as CPUs start to become this this entity in and of itself that can go off and spawn workloads,\N但现在你看到的是，随着 CPU 本身开始成为一个独立实体，能够自主启动工作负载，
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.55,0:38:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,or respond to workloads, they have to manage different uh different models.\N或响应工作负载，它们就必须管理不同的模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.32,0:38:49.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, now it's not all just about launching and managing a single model.\N所以现在，不再只是关于启动和管理单一模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.49,0:38:53.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, a single query might spawn multiple different models.\N一个查询可能会触发多个不同的模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.62,0:38:58.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think what you're seeing is you're seeing the the ratio of CPUs and the growth of CPUs now try to keep up.\N我认为你看到的是，CPU 的比例和 CPU 的增长现在正努力跟上。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.82,0:39:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,At the end of the day, you're deploying massively expensive infrastructure.\N归根结底，你部署的是极其昂贵的基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.28,0:39:09.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're trying to keep that infrastructure operational and drive utilization up as much as possible.\N你们正努力保持基础设施的正常运行，并尽可能提高利用率。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.12,0:39:17.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh if the CPUs become the bottleneck, that is the agents can't call uh additional tools,\N如果 CPU 成为瓶颈，也就是智能体无法调用额外工具，
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.21,0:39:23.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,can't kind of go manage that flow, you've got idle idle technology there, and that's in nobody's interest.\N无法有效管理这一流程，那么就会出现闲置的技术资源，这不符合任何人的利益。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.84,0:39:28.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we know Mohamed that you know, Arm has been in the hyperscale world for a long time.\N所以，我们知道，穆罕默德，Arm 早已长期活跃在超大规模领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.42,0:39:32.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,AWS using Graviton, Google using Axion, and so on and so forth.\NAWS 使用 Graviton，谷歌使用 Axion，依此类推。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.67,0:39:38.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, how do you see enterprises and neo clouds now having access to the AGI CPU?\N那么，您如何看待企业与新兴云服务商如今能够获得 AGI CPU？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.48,0:39:45.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,What lessons can they learn from the hyperscalers, and how can they adopt these processors to be more efficient in their work on workloads?\N他们能从超大规模服务商那里学到哪些经验？又该如何采用这些处理器，以提升其工作负载的效率？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.12,0:39:51.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, what you what you saw with the hyperscalers, so so Arm kind of has been in the in the infrastructure or the data center space.\N你看到超大规模服务商的发展历程，Arm 本质上早已进入基础设施或数据中心领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.47,0:39:52.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We started investing in 2011.\N我们从 2011 年就开始投入。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.96,0:39:56.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, believe it or not, we started investing in the software side in 2011.\N你可能不信，我们早在 2011 年就开始投资软件层面。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.76,0:40:02.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It really started to take off around 2018, 2019 when AWS launched Graviton.\N真正开始腾飞是在 2018 年到 2019 年，当时 AWS 推出了 Graviton。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.64,0:40:03.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,And at that moment,\N正是在那一刻，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.35,0:40:08.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,what they did is — the realization was that if they stopped trying to take\N他们意识到，如果不再拿现成的旧芯片来凑数据中心，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.43,0:40:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,an off-the-shelf uh legacy uh piece of silicon and design their data center around that silicon,\N一款现成的、老旧的硅芯片，然后围绕这款芯片设计他们的数据中心。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.57,0:40:20.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,but rather optimize to the silicon for what they wanted their data center to be,\N而是针对他们希望数据中心成为的样子，对硅片进行优化，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.61,0:40:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,they could get massive uh performance and more importantly for them at the time, efficiency improvements.\N他们可以获得巨大的性能提升，更重要的是，当时对他们而言，还能实现效率的显著改善。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.24,0:40:32.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was a kind of watershed moment because really what happened is a lot of the software\N那是一个具有分水岭意义的时刻，因为实际上发生的是，大量软件发生了变革。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.11,0:40:37.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,started to kind of move over to Arm and other hyperscalers started to uh to follow suit.\N开始转向 Arm，其他超大规模厂商也纷纷效仿。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.61,0:40:45.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, today you've got Google, you have Microsoft, you have AWS, you have Nvidia, all building based on um based on Arm.\N所以，如今谷歌、微软、AWS 和英伟达都在基于 Arm 构建自己的技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.88,0:40:53.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Arm CPUs and they're doing so because they can optimize those systems for whatever system or architecture they want.\NArm 处理器，他们之所以这么做，是因为能够根据所需系统或架构，对这些系统进行优化。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.48,0:40:59.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because of that, you've got over 10,000 companies around the world today that are using Arm in the cloud every day.\N因此，如今全球已有超过1万家公司每天都在云端使用 Arm。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.56,0:41:09.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's it's that install base which has been effectively limited to cloud-based deployments which Arm AGI CPU now makes available to everybody else.\N正是这个原本仅限于云端部署的庞大用户基础，如今通过 Arm AGI CPU 能够向所有人开放。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.91,0:41:14.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you can now get all the benefits of that performance, of that efficiency,\N因此，你现在可以享受到那种性能和效率的全部优势。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.98,0:41:18.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you can get it on prem or you can leverage it in the cloud either way.\N但你可以将其部署在本地，也可以在云端使用，两种方式都可以。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.43,0:41:24.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I think that's the sort of the sort of watershed or difference in the in in in kind of where we are today.\N我认为这就是我们今天所处位置的一个分水岭或本质区别。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.96,0:41:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.\N明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.76,0:41:32.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, when we look at data center infrastructure, we know that the GPUs are getting more power hungry, right?\N所以当我们审视数据中心基础设施时，我们知道GPU的功耗越来越高，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.48,0:41:35.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every year they're using more and more power, right?\N每年它们都在消耗越来越多的电力，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.36,0:41:38.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Arm has always been, you know, thought of as power efficient.\N一直以来，Arm都被认为是功耗高效的。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.70,0:41:47.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, how do you see adding more cores, you know, being more and I guess performance optimized while keeping the power efficiency down.\N那么你如何看待在增加更多核心的同时，还能保持性能优化并降低功耗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.00,0:41:54.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, when we designed Arm AGI CPU, we designed it around three key principles: performance, efficiency, and scale.\N所以在设计Arm AGI CPU时，我们围绕三个核心原则展开：性能、效率和可扩展性。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.20,0:41:56.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those were the three things that mattered the most.\N这三点是最重要的。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.14,0:42:02.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And And if you look at the reality of the world we're living in right now, is we have these massive aspirations for what AI can be.\N如果看看我们当下所处的现实世界，我们会发现对AI能实现什么抱有巨大期望。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.44,0:42:07.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have this massive aspirations for what AGI can get can deliver to us.\N我们对AGI能为我们带来什么也抱有巨大期望。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.08,0:42:09.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we don't have enough power.\N但我们缺乏足够的电力。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.88,0:42:11.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we don't have enough compute.\N我们也缺乏足够的算力。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.07,0:42:12.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's just the reality.\N这就是现实。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.27,0:42:14.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,We just can't build it fast enough.\N我们根本无法建造得足够快。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.51,0:42:19.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, if the world has a fixed footprint of of power,\N因此，如果世界可用的电力空间是固定的，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.88,0:42:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you're trying to put more and more accelerators in there and more and more compute in there,\N而你却在其中不断塞入越来越多的加速器和计算资源，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.54,0:42:30.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,then the common denominator, the the thing the only thing that you can affect is to make that system more and more efficient.\N那么唯一能影响的共同因素，就是让整个系统越来越高效。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.48,0:42:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,That means holistic system design, a lot of the stuff that that, you know,\N这意味着要进行整体系统设计，也就是我们常说的，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.20,0:42:40.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Supermicro works on in terms of making sure that that entire system is efficient when you build it out.\N美超微在构建系统时所专注的，确保整个系统在部署时都高效运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.43,0:42:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh, but it also means that making sure that you've got the most efficient components in and um down to the silicon level.\N哦，这也意味着必须确保从组件到硅片层面都尽可能高效。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.76,0:42:54.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,At the system level within Arm, you know, we've been building efficient CPUs and efficient compute for over 35 years.\N在 Arm 的系统层面，我们已经持续打造高效 CPU 和高效计算超过 35 年。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.72,0:43:02.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every one of you is carrying around a mobile phone that's effectively a supercomputer in your pocket that works off of a battery.\N你们每个人随身携带的手机，本质上就是一台口袋里的超级计算机，靠电池供电。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.48,0:43:09.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're taking those same design principles and now applying it to the data center so we can cram more compute into that fixed power envelope.\N我们正将同样的设计原则应用到数据中心，以便在固定的电力限制内塞入更多计算能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.69,0:43:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And at the end of the day, that's at the heart of what of what we do.\N归根结底，这正是我们工作的核心所在。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.60,0:43:21.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, when you look at the partnership between Arm and Supermicro, where do you see this partnership helping the Neo Clouds,\N所以，当你看到 Arm 和美超微之间的合作时，你认为这一合作如何帮助新兴云服务商，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.31,0:43:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,helping the enterprise get to that next level of power efficiency?\N帮助企业实现能效的下一个层级？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.28,0:43:27.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I've told you and I've told Charles multiple times.\N是的，我跟你们说过，也跟梁见后说过好几次了。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.70,0:43:30.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, I love I love this partnership for a couple of reasons.\N我的意思是，我非常看好这一合作，原因有几点。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.30,0:43:36.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, at the end of the day, we're bringing this kind of, you know, low-power performant efficient compute to the table.\N说到底，我们带来了这种低功耗、高性能、高效率的计算能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.60,0:43:41.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, the reason why we partnered so closely with with Supermicro was was very simple.\N我们之所以与美超微紧密合作，原因非常简单。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.60,0:43:44.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, you guys have this amazing history of execution.\N你们拥有令人惊叹的执行历史。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.94,0:43:49.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have this amazing history of of building out this comprehensive portfolio.\N你们拥有令人惊叹的全面产品组合构建历史。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.94,0:43:53.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, you know, I think Charles talked about all of his building blocks.\N我想，梁见后已经谈到了他所有的积木式方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.18,0:43:56.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, you you see that and it's, you know,\N我的意思是，你们看得到这一点，而且，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.73,0:44:05.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,um as we as we go off and start to kind of make the technology more widely available to a broader group of of customers, two things are clear.\N当我们开始将这项技术更广泛地提供给更广泛的客户群体时，有两点非常明确。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.70,0:44:11.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,One, you know, we needed a partner who could go off and execute and get the job done quickly and kind of deliver some amazing,\N首先，我们需要一个能够独立执行、快速完成任务并交付惊人成果的合作伙伴，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.78,0:44:18.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, amazing products all the way through to to customers who's got that full portfolio that they could kind of bring to bear.\N你知道，从产品到客户，整个产品组合都令人惊叹，客户可以充分利用这些产品。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.71,0:44:24.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I think that combination of the compute that we bring to the table with your history of execution,\N我认为，我们带来的计算能力，与你们在执行方面的历史经验相结合，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.64,0:44:30.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,your depth of supply chain and and and your your broad product portfolio kind of\N你们在供应链上的深度以及广泛的产品组合，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.20,0:44:35.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,allows us to serve just an amazing and an all new set of customers for Arm,\N让我们能够为 Arm 服务一大批前所未有的客户。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.58,0:44:36.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.12,0:44:42.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, everyone talks about, you know, the AI boom and, you know, how long is it going to be around and how long is this going to happen?\N所以，大家都在谈论人工智能的热潮，你知道，它会持续多久，这场热潮还会持续多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.83,0:44:49.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, what are your thoughts on specifically enterprise AI and what you see over the next two to three years?\N那么，你对企业级人工智能有什么看法？未来两到三年你看到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.16,0:44:55.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, I I guess when I think about enterprise AI and I think about where we are within the AI AI cycle,\N嗯，当我思考企业级人工智能，以及我们所处的 AI 发展周期时，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.55,0:44:58.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, we are just it's it's really early innings.\N我们其实才刚刚进入早期阶段。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.87,0:45:00.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think that's what's clear.\N这一点非常明确。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.76,0:45:03.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, you know, it's been adopted in large scale.\N嗯，目前已经在大规模应用。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.32,0:45:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're talking about giga gigawatt scale deployments now within, you know, those those massive data centers.\N我们现在谈论的是，那些大型数据中心中，已经达到吉瓦级的部署规模。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.20,0:45:17.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the reality is is that compute is going to and and AI is going to be pervasive in everything we do.\N但现实是，计算能力将无处不在，人工智能也将渗透到我们所做的每一件事中。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.08,0:45:20.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's going to be pervasive in our pocket, in our IT cabinet.\N它将无处不在，出现在我们的口袋里，出现在我们的IT机柜中。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.24,0:45:24.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's going to be pervasive in our automobiles and our robotics.\N它将无处不在，出现在我们的汽车和机器人中。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.14,0:45:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's going to be pervasive kind of end to end.\N它将实现端到端的全面渗透。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.65,0:45:31.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, it isn't just about what we've been focused on, which are just those big data centers.\N所以，这不仅仅是关于我们过去关注的那些大型数据中心。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.23,0:45:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those are going to evolve.\N那些数据中心将不断演进。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.32,0:45:33.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're going to have to grow.\N它们必须不断扩展。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.46,0:45:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to have to put more and more compute in them.\N我们必须在其中投入越来越多的计算能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.57,0:45:38.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to have to get more and more efficient in how we do that.\N我们必须在如何实现这一点上变得越来越高效。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.20,0:45:42.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,But then you need that kind of synergy from there all the way down to those end points.\N但与此同时，你还需要从那里到终端设备之间形成这种协同效应。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.44,0:45:49.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think the future's incredibly exciting because there there is so much potential associated with AI that we just we just haven't realized yet.\N我认为未来令人无比兴奋，因为人工智能所蕴含的潜力巨大，而我们至今尚未完全意识到。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.32,0:45:53.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're we're really just, you know, we're just laying the foundations.\N我们其实才刚刚在打基础，可以说，我们才刚刚起步。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.16,0:45:58.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, you know, it's every day there's a new application and a new use case and we're just really scratching the surface.\N嗯，你知道，每天都有新的应用和新的使用场景出现，我们才刚刚触及表面。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.15,0:46:03.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I'm really excited to see what happens.\N所以，我真的很期待接下来会发生什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.16,0:46:10.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, as you can see, we already prepared so many architectural with your CPU.\N好的，如你所见，我们已经为你的CPU准备了这么多架构。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.92,0:46:11.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.\N完全正确。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.64,0:46:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number one standard system level whatever configuration customer one already.\N第一标准系统级，无论客户一的何种配置。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.84,0:46:22.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is what I mean, execution.\N这就是我想说的，执行。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.41,0:46:23.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at this.\N看这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.14,0:46:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, I we we we kind of showed it to them and and you know, the more than one of these platforms came about because we had a customer and you know,\N我的意思是，我们曾向他们展示过，而且你知道，这些平台中的多个都是因为有了客户，才迅速成型的。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.80,0:46:37.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I called Charles and Matt up and said, "Hey, we've got this customer they're looking and immediately turned something around.\N我打电话给查尔斯和马特，说：“嘿，我们有位客户，他们正在寻找，我们立刻就做出了回应。”
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.24,0:46:39.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I think that's exactly what what I'm talking about.\N所以，这正是我所谈论的情况。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.40,0:46:40.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, I need the your chip.\N不，我需要你的芯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.00,0:46:41.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're ready.\N我们准备好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.74,0:46:42.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go.\N开始吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.31,0:46:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go.\N开始吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.88,0:46:43.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.\N当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.62,0:46:44.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.\N当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.36,0:46:45.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, it should be very soon, right?\N所以，应该很快就会实现，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.92,0:46:49.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we we're going to be in production within within a few months here.\N是的，我们将在几个月内投入生产。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.76,0:46:51.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we're really excited about it.\N我们对此非常期待。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.36,0:46:52.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Really excited about it.\N真的非常期待。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.60,0:46:53.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good.\N很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.16,0:46:57.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, for customer here we are ready to take order.\N所以，对客户来说，我们现在已准备好接收订单。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.68,0:46:58.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.\N当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.79,0:46:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.\N来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.00,0:47:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.44,0:47:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Charles.\N梁见后。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.20,0:47:01.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.68,0:47:02.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.\N非常感谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.52,0:47:02.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Charles.\N谢谢你，梁见后。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.88,0:47:03.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.32,0:47:03.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Matt.\N谢谢，马特。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.92,0:47:04.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.24,0:47:07.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.32,0:47:11.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, that's the how Supermicro building block solution advantage, right?\N所以，这就是美超微积木式方案的优势，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.23,0:47:18.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a building block solution for board level, for system level, for rack level, for data center level.\N我们在板级、系统级、机架级和数据中心级都提供积木式方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.10,0:47:26.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And again, our management software, our switch all support the all our Nvidia chip, all our AMD chip, all our Arm chip.\N而且，我们的管理软件和交换机全面支持所有英伟达芯片、所有 AMD 芯片和所有 Arm 芯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.71,0:47:27.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,\N所以，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.00,0:47:31.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are kind of a truly a building block solution family and\N我们实际上是一套真正的积木式方案家族，且
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.85,0:47:39.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,very happy to work with Arm and uh that's what we're prepared.\N非常高兴能与 Arm 合作，这正是我们准备好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.35,0:47:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good.\N很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.88,0:47:43.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we covered a lot of ground today.\N今天我们覆盖了大量内容。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.08,0:47:50.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, to recap some of our key value of Supermicro data center building block solution, DCBBS.\N现在，来总结一下美超微数据中心积木式解决方案 DCBBS 的一些核心价值。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.84,0:47:59.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Supermicro's DCBBS leverages 33 years of optimized building block solution.\N美超微的 DCBBS 借助了 33 年来优化的积木式方案经验。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.44,0:48:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh Optimize our leverage our building block solution DNA.\N我们优化并充分发挥了积木式方案的基因优势。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.32,0:48:11.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,The technology is so good that we had uh successfully deploy the DLC liquid-cooling\N这项技术非常出色，我们两年前曾成功在不到 5 个月内部署了液冷数据中心，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.74,0:48:19.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,data center in under 5 months uh 2 years ago and recently under 3 months,\N而最近一次更是不到 3 个月就完成，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.96,0:48:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.44,0:48:26.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, all of those are uh world record because of building block solution because of DCBBS.\N所有这些都创下了世界纪录，归功于积木式方案，归功于 DCBBS。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.44,0:48:29.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, everything fully designed, pre-validated.\N再次强调，所有组件均已完成设计并预先验证。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.76,0:48:34.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, when we ship to you, it's ready for plug and play.\N因此，当我们交付给您时，即可即插即用。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.31,0:48:36.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,True plug and play, right?\N真正的即插即用，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.00,0:48:44.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh by uh uh perfectly unify our optimized compute, storage, power,\N通过完美整合我们优化的计算、存储、供电、
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.88,0:48:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,network, rack, scale integration, software, and turnkey uh DLC technology,\N网络、机架级集成、软件以及现成的液冷技术，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.12,0:48:58.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,DCBBS uh unlock the best performance and time to market uh\NDCBBS 解锁了最佳性能和最短上市时间，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.98,0:49:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,while lowering uh energy consumption and cost for your overall data center.\N同时降低数据中心整体的能耗和成本。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.40,0:49:15.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh by condensing uh traditional uh 12 months to 18 months data center time to operation,\N通过把传统数据中心 12 到 18 个月的上线时间压缩到几个月，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.90,0:49:21.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh now again lots of data center uh work with us with our DCBBS.\N现在，已有大量数据中心选择与我们合作，采用我们的 DCBBS。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.50,0:49:28.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are able to build from contract to operation in 6 to\N我们能够实现从签约到投入运营仅需6至
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.36,0:49:33.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh to 7 months or even sometime even uh uh 4 months,\N7个月，甚至有时仅需4个月，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.78,0:49:34.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.30,0:49:39.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we have uh some really good experience with that and that's why I want to share with you here.\N所以，我们在那方面有非常棒的经验，这也是为什么我想在这里与大家分享的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.81,0:49:43.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh go for our DCBBS together, right?\N那就让我们一起推进DCBBS，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.09,0:49:49.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,DCBBS directly success the supply chain, uh guarantee hardware quality,\NDCBBS直接打通供应链，确保硬件质量，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.45,0:49:57.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,and protect customer uh from the massive uh capital loss of any idle data center.\N并保护客户免受任何闲置数据中心带来的巨大资本损失。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.44,0:50:08.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh before we close, uh let's put it back to the ultimate business equation uh for every partner and customer in this room.\N在结束之前，让我们回到在座每一位合作伙伴和客户最根本的商业方程式。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.66,0:50:19.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember uh data center building block solution, the advantage is the uh much faster technology time to market.\N记住，数据中心积木式解决方案的优势在于技术上市时间大大缩短。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.80,0:50:28.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then our huge production global uh footprint uh guarantee uh time to delivery.\N同时，我们庞大的全球生产布局确保了交付时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.31,0:50:39.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we build a some uh gigawatt data center uh build everything and ship it to customer in 1 month or 1 and 1/2 months.\N我们可以建设一个吉瓦级的数据中心，完成所有工作并在一个月或一个半月内交付给客户。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.56,0:50:50.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And sometime uh I believe we can beat within 3 week or 4 week for a gigawatt data center because of building block solution.\N有时我相信，凭借积木式方案，我们甚至能在三到四周内完成一个吉瓦级数据中心的建设。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.13,0:50:55.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And also because of our global huge uh production capacity now.\N同时也得益于我们如今巨大的全球生产能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.41,0:51:01.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,6 million square feet uh everything uh we are trained, uh we are automatic, right?\N六百万平方英尺的产能，训练有素、高度自动化，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.92,0:51:06.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So uh um we with all those advantage, again time to market,\N所以，凭借这些优势，再次强调，上市时间大大缩短，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.92,0:51:18.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,time to deployment, and time to online, uh time to make a money, right?\N部署时间，上线时间，还有赚取收益的时间，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.12,0:51:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,DCBBS uh we start introduce DCBBS since about 20 months ago.\NDCBBS，我们大约从20个月前开始推出DCBBS。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.96,0:51:29.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now we have a most of uh DCBBS components uh subsystem already.\N现在我们已经具备了大部分DCBBS组件和子系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.62,0:51:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they work perfectly with our management software.\N它们与我们的管理软件完美兼容。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.20,0:51:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,So uh everything ready there.\N所以一切都已经就绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.64,0:51:42.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything uh uh kind of ready for you.\N所有东西都基本就绪，随时可以使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.21,0:51:45.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh to save your time, save your money.\N为了节省您的时间，节省您的资金。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.24,0:51:48.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's work together and keep IT green.\N让我们携手合作，让IT更绿色。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.20,0:51:50.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep the data center green and AI green.\N让数据中心更绿色，让AI更绿色。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.64,0:51:51.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.84,0:51:53.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow, thank you.\N哇，谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.88,0:51:55.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.46,0:51:57.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.\N谢谢了。
